<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1316] Zeppelin can not start due to an incorrect Interpreter Setting</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1316</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;it is defined in the Interpreter Setting, if the actual Interpreter is not present.&lt;br/&gt;
Zeppelin will not be executed.&lt;br/&gt;
And a 503 error displays in a web browser, without modifying the part Zeppelin is not available.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
