&lt;p&gt;    This will ignore non-exist setting if it doesn&apos;t exist anymore in `interpreter/*`. I think it looks realistic in production level because admin usually delete that interpreter setting if it doesn&apos;t exists. LGTM&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
